{/*AUTOGENERATED_START*/}

import SettingsInfoBlock from "/snippets/components/SettingsInfoBlock/SettingsInfoBlock.jsx";

These settings configure the ClickHouse server and are autogenerated from ClickHouse source.

## logger.console {#logger.console}

<SettingsInfoBlock type="Bool" default_value="0" changeable_without_restart="No" />Enable logging to the console. Set to `<1>` or `<true>` to enable. Default is `<1>` if ClickHouse does not run in daemon mode, `<0>` otherwise.

## logger.console_log_level {#logger.console_log_level}

